[00:20.16]1. How does it make you feel
[00:23.16]when you preach and teach with zeal,
[00:26.49]When you know you’ve done your part
[00:29.49]to reach an honest heart?
[00:32.49]Knowing you’ve done your best;
[00:47.13]then our God will do the rest.
[00:49.46]Honest hearts he surely knows—
[00:51.80]all those to him disposed.
[00:54.13](Chorus)
[00:57.80]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[01:01.46]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[01:05.13]So may our sacrifice of praise
[01:12.55]continue all our days.
[01:19.96]2. How does it make you feel
[01:23.96]when the words you speak appeal
[01:27.96]To the ones whose heart is right
[01:31.96]for everlasting life?
[01:38.49]Some people turn away,
[01:42.74]others might be led astray.
[01:46.99]Still we’re glad to bear his name
[01:50.49]and witness just the same.
[01:56.64](Chorus)
[01:59.64]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[02:02.64]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[02:05.64]So may our sacrifice of praise
[02:33.82]continue all our days.
[03:02.01]3. How does it make you feel,
[03:05.71]knowing God’s support is real,
[03:09.41]And that he’s entrusted you
[03:12.91]to do the work we do?
[03:21.12]Proudly we preach and teach,
[03:23.12]using bold but gracious speech,
[03:28.12]Searching out deserving ones;
[03:31.12]this work will soon be done.
[03:34.42](Chorus)
[03:37.72]It makes us glad, and we rejoice
[03:42.28]to give our heart and mind and voice.
[03:46.92]So may our sacrifice of praise
[03:50.36]continue all our days.